<title>UK: EUROPE RAW COTTON FLUCTUATES IN NARROW RANGE.</title>
<headline>EUROPE RAW COTTON FLUCTUATES IN NARROW RANGE.</headline>
<dateline>LIVERPOOL 1997-08-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trading in European raw cotton markets stayed very dull pending the U.S. Department of Agriculture August crop report and asking prices fluctuated narrowly.</p>
</text>
